OL,3,GNEWSABiosphere artist 'inspired by
OL,4,Aisland's magic'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe outgoing biosphere artist in
OL,7,Fresidence has said the reception she
OL,8,Freceived while in the post was "way
OL,9,Fbeyond what I was expecting".
OL,11,FMusician and visual artist Alice Dudley
OL,12,Fbecame the fourth person to take up the
OL,13,Fposition with the Manx Wildlife Trust
OL,14,Fin November last year.
OL,16,FDuring her tenure she held workshops
OL,17,Fwhich took her out into the community
OL,18,Falongside working on a Manx folklore
OL,19,Finspired musical project which
OL,20,Fculminated in the launch of an album
OL,21,Finspired by the island's "magic and
OL,22,Fmystery".
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB IOM NewsC Reg TVF Clean Feed
